00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.730
- Research suggests that PTSD

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:09.170
can be triggered by new stressors.

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:10.850
- Like losing your family.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:12.050
- I need to get to work
on the opening statement,

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:14.203
but we need to be sure Castle
will get on board with this.

00:00:14.203 --> 00:00:16.060
- (sighs) I'll try.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:19.240
- So have they not spoken
to their client before?

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:23.670
Pro tip, if trial is tomorrow,
you really, really, really

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.500
