00:00:27.743 --> 00:00:31.360
(Whimsical music)

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:32.230
Hey, legal eagles.

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:34.170
It's time to think like a lawyer.

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:36.800
Today, we are covering
