or the prosecution.

00:25:11.250 --> 00:25:13.430
it's some interesting expert testimony.

00:25:13.430 --> 00:25:16.070
On the other hand, man!

00:25:16.070 --> 00:25:18.250
You can't make a speech in
the middle of an examination.

00:25:18.250 --> 00:25:19.083
That's insane.

00:25:19.083 --> 00:25:21.210
There's so much procedurally going wrong.

00:25:21.210 --> 00:25:22.950
This trial would have taken months,

00:25:22.950 --> 00:25:25.330
and they're really just shortening it

00:25:25.330 --> 00:25:26.760
for dramatic effect, obviously.

00:25:26.760 --> 00:25:31.460
So overall, I give the trial
of Frank Castle a solid C.

00:25:31.460 --> 00:25:32.410
It's okay.

00:25:32.410 --> 00:25:36.220
It needs some work, but it's entertaining.

